    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SUMMARY</h2><br>This is a 2D old-school RPG in the vein of Last Heroes and Skyfall.<br><br>Aala is a curious and dedicated young woman living with her brother in the peaceful village of Whitehollow. With an ever increasing curiousity for stories, she found a great source of them in an older villager named Dagon. A seasoned pirate who sailed all four corners of the world in his youth. One day, Aala hears from Dagon a different story, one that will change her life forever, one in which she is the hero.<br><br>A beast of unmeasurable power is rising from the depths of the sea, it seeks to engulf the world with it's dark tentacles, it's up to Aala to stop the Kraken.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mythological storyline taking reference from the greath myths and fairy tales<br></li><li>A vast and varied world to explore, from snowy places, to green and desertic ones<br></li><li>Sidequests to complete that adds to the world's lore<br></li><li>A quest journal to keep track of your objectives<br></li><li>Mouse support<br></li><li>Over 15 hours of gameplay</li></ul>",
